<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101937" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοινο-τενής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τείνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stretched out like a measuring line</i>: hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>drawn in a straight line</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διώρυχες,
				διέξοδοι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.189
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				199
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοινοτενὲς ποιήσασθαι</span> to
			draw <i>a straight line</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>stretched out, prolix</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Her.</u>
					19.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔννοιαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					946.8
				</span></i>
			; of rhetorical <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶλα</span>
			exceeding a certain length, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4.4
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τενῶς</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				4.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>twisted</i> or <i>plaited of rushes</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπυρίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.5
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
